{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unwind and engage your mind with Consonance, a relaxing puzzle game featuring animated, monochromatic images. Rearrange the pieces to reveal each unique animated scene, challenging yourself with puzzles containing up to 100 pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750640/extras/desc.gif?t=1749179957\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PERSONALIZE YOUR EXPERIENCE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A gallery of 37 levels</strong>: Discover a collection of unique, minimalist, animated images.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tailor the challenge</strong>: Adjust the difficulty by choosing the number of pieces, from an easy 4-piece to a demanding 100-piece puzzle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Soothing Soundscapes</strong>: Set the mood with a selection of 10 calming background tracks composed by Ovani Sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High Replay Value:</strong> Every level features randomized elements, ensuring each playthrough offers a different experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3750640?t=1749179957","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3750640?t=1749179957","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750640/435821bc45acc7d3a3059b054207f3b76464c1b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749179957","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750640/435821bc45acc7d3a3059b054207f3b76464c1b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749179957","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":